  Sign, us/attempt                    117.34 +/-  0.88       77.12 +/-  1.59
  PreSign, us/attempt                 117.06 +/-  3.77       75.63 +/-  0.44

--- adaptor overhead WITHIN each construction (the primary comparison) ---
    PAIRED and INTERLEAVED: each pair alternates within every repetition,
    so clock drift is common-mode; mean +/- SD over the 5 per-rep ratios.
  pair                       Simplified Dilithium-II              ML-DSA-44
  PreSign vs Sign (/attempt)             1.3% +/-  2.1             3.8% +/-  1.9
  PreVerify vs Verify                    5.1% +/-  2.8             0.8% +/-  0.9
  Adapt vs Verify                        7.3% +/-  0.5             6.9% +/-  5.4
  (Extract has no basic analogue in either construction. PreSign is
   compared per ATTEMPT, so the realised restart counts cannot bias it.)

--- rejection sampling (counted directly, never inferred) ---
